---
title: contrai-scraper — a shift (Shift.run)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Schedule : contrai-scrape run

    Schedule : <b>schedule gate</b><br/>is_active(now) in [schedule].timezone
    Idle : <b>idle</b><br/>no browser open<br/>schedule_idle logged once, with the next opening
    Egress : <b>egress gate</b><br/>exit address is not home · expected country<br/>route through the tunnel device
    Blocked : <b>egress_blocked</b><br/>nothing sent to the site
    Session : <b>session</b><br/>prune old raw logs · a fresh raw log<br/>open the browser · log in · enter the variant
    Watching : <b>Recorder.run</b><br/>seat · gate · watch · write · hop<br/>egress re-checked before every hop<br/>and when a table goes quiet
    Failed : <b>session_failed</b><br/>a browser error, or frames that ended
    Handback : <b>exit 3</b><br/>a budget is spent<br/>the container is restarted

    Schedule --> Idle : outside every range
    Idle --> Schedule : after idle_poll_minutes
    Schedule --> Egress : inside a range<br/>(schedule_resume after an idle)
    Egress --> Blocked : a check refuses
    Blocked --> Schedule : after idle_poll_minutes
    Blocked --> Handback : 6 refusals in a row
    Egress --> Session : egress_ok
    Session --> Watching
    Session --> Failed : raises
    Watching --> Failed : raises, or SOURCE_ENDED
    Failed --> Schedule : after idle_poll_minutes
    Failed --> Handback : 3 failures in a row
    Watching --> Schedule : window closed (plus overrun)<br/>or egress blocked mid-session
    Watching --> [*] : --max-games or --minutes reached

    note right of Watching
        SIGTERM, in any state, cancels the run:
        the game in hand is written as interrupted
        and the process exits 130.
    end note

    classDef gate fill:#DCD2F0,stroke:#5E4495,stroke-width:2px,color:#2E1F52
    classDef work fill:#EDE7F6,stroke:#5E4495,stroke-width:1px,color:#2E1F52
    classDef rest fill:#EEEEEE,stroke:#616161,stroke-width:1px,color:#424242
    classDef fault fill:#FDECEA,stroke:#B3261E,stroke-width:2px,color:#5F1410

    class Schedule,Egress gate
    class Session,Watching work
    class Idle rest
    class Blocked,Failed,Handback fault
